{"4304840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "No Hesitation", "steam_appid": 4304840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hesitation</strong> is a small, cozy game made for people who simply enjoy being on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, uninterrupted highways. Dense but smooth-flowing traffic. No scores to chase, no timers ticking down, no pressure to win. You’re not here to be faster — you’re here to settle into the rhythm of driving and just keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cars feel grounded and believable without demanding too much from you. Drift gently through traffic or slow down and take it all in. The game doesn’t push you. It lets you breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those moments when you want to put on some music, clear your head, get lost in traffic, and enjoy the calm of being behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your hands on the wheel. No rush. Just the road ahead.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Hesitation</strong> is a small, cozy game made for people who simply enjoy being on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, uninterrupted highways. Dense but smooth-flowing traffic. No scores to chase, no timers ticking down, no pressure to win. You’re not here to be faster — you’re here to settle into the rhythm of driving and just keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cars feel grounded and believable without demanding too much from you. Drift gently through traffic or slow down and take it all in. The game doesn’t push you. It lets you breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for those moments when you want to put on some music, clear your head, get lost in traffic, and enjoy the calm of being behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your hands on the wheel. No rush. Just the road ahead.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A cozy, stres